Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Thermodynamics", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974762982149719*^9, 
  3.974763012806987*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cc3222c3-0578-4231-a00c-\
3aa8f668bd03"],

Cell["\<\
Statistical Physics of Particles by Kardar: Computations and Visualizations\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974762992459153*^9, 
  3.974763024083053*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3ac18f31-4dd2-4904-8b54-\
f68e217f4623"],

Cell["1.4 The Second Law", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97476307490744*^9, 
  3.974763083551244*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e0284eb7-06d2-4995-93f2-\
58f544e388d7"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1.5 Carnot Engines", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763096057108*^9, 
  3.974763100177144*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"437a99ed-86bc-4f0e-81a5-\
b203c7dadf0f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A Carnot Engine is any engine that is reversible, runs in a cycle, with all \
of its heat exchanges taking place at a source temperature ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["H", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "T_H", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6795d33f-4350-4b70-bac3-66cb6965610f"],
 ", and a sing temperature ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["C", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "T_C", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b9a049f2-f36d-4ca1-a87e-94d1a8400f99"],
 ". A reversible process is one that can be run backward in time by simply \
reversing its inputs and outputs. It is the thermodynamic equivalence of \
frictionless motion in mechanics.\n\nSince time reversibility implies \
equilibrium, a reversible transformation must be quasi-static, but reverse is \
not necessarily true.\n\nThe distinguishing characteristic of the Carnot \
engine is that heat exchanges with the surroundings are carried out only at \
two temperatures. The zeroth law allow us to select two isotherms at \
temperatures ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["H", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "T_H", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "df7af2c7-0771-46ec-82d0-0437d6154906"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["T", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["C", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "T_C", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "cfece9d9-e5ec-4640-8491-cfae3c48aef6"],
 " for these heat exchanges. To complete the Carnot cycle we have to connect \
these isotherms by reversible adiabatic paths in the coordinate space.\n\n\
Since heat is not a function of state, we don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t know how to \
construct such paths in general. Fortunately, we have sufficient information \
at this point to construct a Carnot engine using an ideal gas as its internal \
working substance. Let us compute the adiabatic curves for a monoatomic ideal \
gas with an internal energy:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763111112978*^9, 
  3.974763428017329*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8df20805-c475-4507-8f8c-\
2fc7ad037ac8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"EnergyPressureVolumeIdealGas", "[", 
   RowBox[{"P_", ",", "V_"}], "]"}], ":=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", "P", " ", "V"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.974763580075643*^9, {3.974763652530308*^9, 3.9747636581040373`*^9}, {
   3.9747637753136663`*^9, 3.974763798725707*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[3]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c500cf69-747f-495d-9e42-40b2b18155ca"],

Cell["Thus we can differentiate:", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763587057107*^9, 
  3.974763592009008*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"8f814fd2-6a10-4dff-a00b-\
ebf8fcd0c41e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "Making", " ", "a", " ", "function", " ", "for", " ", "total", " ", 
    "differentials"}], " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"d", "[", 
    RowBox[{"f_", ",", "vars_List"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"D", "[", 
        RowBox[{"f", ",", "#"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "#", "]"}]}], "&"}], "/@", "vars"}], 
    "]"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763909124892*^9, 3.974763909124918*^9}, {
   3.97476399607019*^9, 3.974763998702999*^9}, 3.974764061009774*^9, {
   3.974764106609721*^9, 3.974764120861615*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[4]:=",ExpressionUUID->"294bcc29-0451-45b5-916f-35d5a08575e9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"dQ", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"d", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"EnergyPressureVolumeIdealGas", "[", 
       RowBox[{"P", ",", "V"}], "]"}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"V", ",", "P"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"P", " ", 
     RowBox[{"DifferentialD", "[", "V", "]"}]}]}], "//", 
   "Expand"}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763613539192*^9, 3.974763672731525*^9}, {
  3.974763810492992*^9, 3.9747638225991373`*^9}, {3.9747640057819357`*^9, 
  3.97476403106172*^9}, {3.9747640690014133`*^9, 3.974764099019706*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[5]:=",ExpressionUUID->"dfbd46b3-6a27-4d67-bd77-5ee6e49d7a77"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"P", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "V"}]}], "+", 
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", "V", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "P", "]"}]}], "+", 
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", "P", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "V", "]"}]}]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974763635239829*^9, 3.974763673172805*^9}, {
   3.97476380529944*^9, 3.974763815124096*^9}, {3.9747640259438267`*^9, 
   3.974764031446464*^9}, {3.974764078262372*^9, 3.974764099809949*^9}, 
   3.9747666329258137`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[5]=",ExpressionUUID->"a70dff7d-a8d0-4db6-a891-51e0f590d657"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now in an adiabatic condition ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         OverscriptBox[
          StyleBox["d", "TI"], "_"], 
         StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\bar dQ", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e4af61d9-472d-4c46-967a-9ffb6dfb7037"],
 " is zero thus:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974764127294346*^9, 
  3.9747641729792*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"73236271-c61f-449c-a432-d23e5205071d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"dQ", " ", "==", "0"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9747641742964*^9, 3.974764179637567*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[6]:=",ExpressionUUID->"c5a20b73-a718-4083-8aa1-a0f06fe8e043"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"P", " ", 
    RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "V"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", "V", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "P", "]"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{
    FractionBox["3", "2"], " ", "P", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "V", "]"}]}]}], "\[Equal]", "0"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.9747641820595407`*^9, 3.9747642217187653`*^9, 
  3.9747666341992607`*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[6]=",ExpressionUUID->"c3f5aeeb-b7f7-4e00-96c6-a0e094a492f9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"2", " ", "dQ"}], " ", "==", "0"}], "//", "Expand"}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.974764184356269*^9, 3.974764246993186*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[7]:=",ExpressionUUID->"555d24af-a798-47be-841b-3573e7d5422d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"2", " ", "P", " ", 
    RowBox[{"\[DifferentialD]", "V"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{"3", " ", "V", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "P", "]"}]}], "+", 
   RowBox[{"3", " ", "P", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Dt", "[", "V", "]"}]}]}], "\[Equal]", "0"}]], "Output",
